#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:76
msgid "Disable wp-admin"
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:76
msgid ""
"Returns a 401 error for requests to /wp-admin, completely blocking access to"
" the WordPress dashboard. admin-ajax.php and admin-post.php stay reachable "
"so forms and plugins on the site keep working. Turn it off again to log in "
"to wp-admin."
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:78
msgid "Mitigate Spam Logins and Comments"
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:78
msgid ""
"Drops POST requests to wp-login.php and wp-comments-post.php that don't come"
" with a Referer from the same site, stopping bots that submit logins and "
"comments directly."
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:80
msgid "Block access to wp-config.php"
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:80
msgid ""
"Directly blocks any HTTP requests to the wp-config.php file, preventing "
"exposure of database credentials even if PHP processing fails."
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:82
msgid "Disable PHP in uploads"
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:82
msgid ""
"Scans for any .php files within /wp-content/uploads/ and blocks them. "
"Essential for preventing malicious shells from running after an unauthorized"
" file upload."
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:84
msgid "Block access to xmlrpc.php"
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:84
msgid ""
"Returns a 403 error for all xmlrpc.php requests. Disables XML-based remote "
"publishing and Pingbacks to prevent DDoS and brute-force amplification."
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:86
msgid "Protect Environment Files"
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:86
msgid ""
"Blocks public access to .env (including .env.local, .env.production and "
"similar), .htaccess, and .htpasswd files in any folder, which often contain "
"high-value secrets and server configurations."
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:88
msgid "Protect Sensitive Files"
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:88
msgid ""
"Uses Regex to block access to backup files (.bak, .swp), readme/license "
"files, and dangerous extensions like .log, .sh, or .exe."
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:90
msgid "Block Author Enumeration"
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:90
msgid ""
"Blocks requests containing the \"author=\" query parameter and the REST API "
"users list (/wp-json/wp/v2/users), stopping bots from discovering valid "
"administrative usernames. Logged in users can still use the users endpoint, "
"so the block editor keeps working."
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:92
msgid "Block Malicious Bots"
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:92
msgid ""
"Uses a User-Agent filter to block aggressive scrapers and security scanners "
"like AhrefsBot, SemrushBot, MJ12bot, and Nikto."
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:94
msgid "Restrict wp-includes PHP"
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:94
msgid ""
"Blocks all PHP execution in the wp-includes folder, with a specific "
"exclusion for wp-tinymce.php to ensure the editor keeps working."
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:96
msgid "Disable PHP in Cache"
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:96
msgid ""
"Prevents the execution of PHP scripts stored within cache directories, "
"stopping \"cache poisoning\" or \"file inclusion\" exploits."
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:98
msgid "Disable Script Concatenation"
msgstr ""

#: internal/modules/websites/render_dispatch.go:98
msgid ""
"Blocks access to load-scripts.php and load-styles.php. This prevents a "
"common ReDoS vulnerability used to spike server CPU via the admin dashboard."
msgstr ""

